{"a":[47,47],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 40.6 40.6 49.6 60.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 49.6 60.7 69.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve işte, böyle - bu güzel, bu bedi' indiriş tarziyle <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"187\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 186.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 46.6 46.6 58.6 58.6 66.0 81.7 98.3 98.3 105.0 112.6 112.6 128.3 128.3 135.0 141.7 141.7 149.3 156.7 156.7 163.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 39.7 81.7 105.0 135.0 149.3 163.6 170.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sana kitab indirdik ya Muhammed<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"206\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 206.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 39.8 46.6 46.6 58.6 58.6 66.0 81.8 81.8 90.8 90.8 99.8 106.6 113.3 113.3 120.0 126.8 126.8 142.6 153.0 159.8 159.8 168.8 168.8 176.3 183.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 39.8 106.6 120.0 142.6 168.8 183.0 189.8\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onun için kendilerine kitab verdiklerimiz - gerek Yehûd ve gerek Nesârâ, Abdullah ibni Selâm gibi hakıkaten kitâbdan istifade etmek nı'metine mazher edilenler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"102\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 102.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 39.0 49.4 57.7 57.7 64.4 64.4 71.2 71.2 71.2 79.4 79.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 86.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ona, o sana indirilen kitaba iyman ediyorlar. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"103\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 103.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 35.2 35.2 35.2 35.2 43.4 43.4 43.4 61.4 61.4 72.0 72.0 78.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 78.7 87.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şunlardan da - ya'ni Arabdan da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"114\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 113.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 39.0 39.0 49.4 49.4 56.2 56.2 56.2 64.4 64.4 80.2 80.2 90.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"90.7 97.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ona iyman eden var<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"264\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 263.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.8 42.8 49.6 56.3 68.3 68.3 75.8 91.6 96.0 103.6 103.6 119.3 119.3 126.0 132.8 132.8 139.6 146.3 153.0 153.0 159.8 159.8 175.6 175.6 184.6 197.3 197.3 210.0 225.8 232.6 239.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 56.3 96.0 126.0 146.3 184.6 210.0 232.6 239.3 247.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bizim âyetlerimizi ancak kâfirler inkâr eder - hakkı örtmeğe alışmış, gâvurluğu âdet edinmiş, cehûd kâfirler ki Yehûdî Kâ'b ibni Eşref ve arkadaşları gibi.</p>"}